      "writtenOn": "2025-02-24T11:07:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This should live at [1] if we want to support immediates in render bundles.\n\nAlso we need to clarify with the group what happens on RenderBundle start/end because at the moment no \"bindings\" state is inherited in render bundles. So let\u0027s start discussing there and add a TODO in [2] to revisit once the group has made a decision. The who options I see is that either immediates are inherited, or that they are cleared to 0.",
      "revId": "334f58284607f2f75b8cdb7731a1536567e47a8e",
